  "description": "Units, quantities and models on the Ranvier reactive graph: an SI unit catalogue with prefixes, parsing and conversion, physical constants with their uncertainty, first-order and Monte Carlo propagation of uncertainty, a one-line formula notation whose results are model entries, and runs: simulations advanced with a clock, with an ODE integrator.",
  "id": "Ranvier.Quantities",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-11-23T13:36:44.94Z",
  "licenseExpression": "MIT",
