  "published": "2026-11-23T13:30:25.507Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.2.1: adds .Traced package twins (Ranvier.Numerics.Traced, Ranvier.Quantities.Traced, Ranvier.Statistics.Traced) built with RANVIER_TRACE on Ranvier.Traced 0.2.1. Numerics: special functions, roots, minimisation and least squares, quadrature and differentiation, ODE integration, interpolation, dense linear algebra, the Fourier transform, streaming and windowed accumulators, random variates. Quantities: an SI unit catalogue with prefixes, parsing and conversion, CODATA 2022 physical constants, first-order and Monte Carlo propagation of uncertainty, formula entries, runs with an ODE integrator. Statistics: distributions, descriptive statistics, intervals, hypothesis tests, a sequential test, multiple-testing adjustments, regression, correlation, curve fitting, the bootstrap and density estimation. Built on Ranvier 0.2.1. The interfaces will change before 1.0.",
